  "description": "ECOSEV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C96 H134 Cl2 La5 Li1 N2 O7 S10 Si4,C7 H8. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 2 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 2 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 0 O neighbors; La1B (La) has 2 O neighbors; La2B (La) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.937-4.096 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.52-111.41°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C96H134Cl2La5LiN2O7S10Si4·C7H8.",
